    "detailed_description": "This is Banana! <br><br>Have you ever heard of the 3-second rule? There is a rather convenient rule in Japan that says that if you drop food, you can eat it within 3 seconds.<br>In this game, a banana ventures to the dining table to be placed on the plate of the dining table. However, if you touch the floor or a wall for more than 3 seconds, you will not be able to eat it, so try to use a desk or a chair as much as possible to reach the goal while following the 3-second rule.<br><br>There are three stages.<br><br><strong>*About the multiplayer mode<br>This is implemented, but the behavior is not stable. Please consider it as a bonus. </strong><br>Multiplayer rules... You win when you use the &quot;explosion,&quot; a unique ability of bananas that everyone knows, to drop your opponent's bananas on the floor and let them rot.<br><br>\uff08English is not supported\uff09",
    "about_the_game": "This is Banana! <br><br>Have you ever heard of the 3-second rule? There is a rather convenient rule in Japan that says that if you drop food, you can eat it within 3 seconds.<br>In this game, a banana ventures to the dining table to be placed on the plate of the dining table. However, if you touch the floor or a wall for more than 3 seconds, you will not be able to eat it, so try to use a desk or a chair as much as possible to reach the goal while following the 3-second rule.<br><br>There are three stages.<br><br><strong>*About the multiplayer mode<br>This is implemented, but the behavior is not stable. Please consider it as a bonus. </strong><br>Multiplayer rules... You win when you use the &quot;explosion,&quot; a unique ability of bananas that everyone knows, to drop your opponent's bananas on the floor and let them rot.<br><br>\uff08English is not supported\uff09",
